            },
            "advisory": "Affected versions of the PyJWT package are vulnerable to Denial of Service (DoS) due to unbounded Base64URL decoding of an unused payload segment in b64=false detached JWS tokens. The `PyJWS.decode()` and `PyJWS.decode_complete()` methods in `jwt/api_jws.py` perform Base64URL decoding of the payload segment before checking if the `\"b64\": false\"` option is set, leading to unnecessary resource consumption. An attacker can exploit this by sending a JWS token with an inflated payload segment, causing excessive CPU and memory usage even if the signature is invalid, potentially leading to service disruption.",
            "is_transitive": false,
